{"strongs": "H5154", "word": "נְחוּשָׁה", "translit": "ne.chu.shah", "root": "נחש", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "copper, bronze", "definition": "נְחוּשָׁה and ( Lev 26:19 ; Job 40:18 ) נְחֻשָׁה noun feminine copper, bronze (only in poetry; compare I. נְחשֶׁת ); — ׳ נ always absolute; — 1. copper produced from ore by melting Job 28:2 . 2. copper , doubtless hardened with alloy, = bronze , as material of bow 2Sam 22:35 = Ps 18:35 ; Job 20:24 gates Isa 45:2 figurative of strength Job 40:18 (bones of hippopotamus), compare Job 41:19 , Mic 4:13 (hoofs of Zion); of obstinate brow Isa 48:4 (|| גִּיד בַּרְזֶל עָרְפֶּ֑ךָ ); unproductive earth Lev 26:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5144')\">BDB5144</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5154')\">H5154</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5143')\">BDB5143</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5145')\">BDB5145</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נְחוּשָׁה</bdbheb> and (<ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,18)\">Job 40:18</ref>) <bdbheb>נְחֻשָׁה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>copper, bronze</highlightword> (only in poetry; compare I. <bdbheb>נְחשֶׁת</bdbheb>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> always absolute; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>copper</highlight> produced from ore by melting <ref ref=\"Job 28:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,2)\">Job 28:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>copper</highlight>, doubtless hardened with alloy, = <highlight>bronze</highlight>, as material of bow <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:35\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,35)\">2Sam 22:35</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=